  (text "to Daisy Seed\nDC/DC input" (at 175.26 102.87 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 2a32e4ad-7947-4fb1-89e9-71300f45c365)
  )
  (text "The digital supply rail is generated\nfrom 24V. The isolated DC/DC makes sure\nthat the currents only go through the +12V \nand -12V rail but not the GND connection.\nThis reduces noise and overall current consumption."
